
@api = http://localhost:5001

### 1. API health -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le -> 201 Created
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200551",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/student-assignment"
}

### 4. Doc luot nop vua tao -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thieu du lieu -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST assignment khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200551",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/student-assignment"
}

### 7. GET GUID khong ton tai -> 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. SignalR negotiate dung duong dan -> 200
POST {{api}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. SignalR negotiate sai duong dan -> 404
POST {{api}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Content-Type: application/json

{}
